@cc [owner:ghuntley,label:security] ssh-durable-account-authority
SSH key ownership, approvals, sessions and command receipts MUST be Ash resources
backed by PostgreSQL. Public actions MUST select the user from the authenticated
actor, never from client ownership fields. Porsche MUST NOT access the database.

@cc [owner:ghuntley,label:security] ssh-revocation-no-resurrection
Removing a key MUST revoke subsequent authorization through it, including existing
sessions. Registering it again MUST NOT restore old sessions. Accepted durable
machine operations MUST continue independently of SSH connection or key lifetime.
